1417 0 obj
  << /ActualText ( \050VR surgical training\051 and Pragyan AI \050AI patient simulation web app\051 from discovery and research through to UI\054 design system\054 and handoff\056\nRedesigned core VR interaction flows based on usability testing findings\073 reduced observed user errors and navigational friction across 3 testing cycles with medical professionals\056\nBuilt a structured QA process for design\055to\055dev handoff\054 reviewing shipped builds against design specs and flagging visual drift before client releases\054 materially reducing visual regression in production\056\nConducted on\055site user training sessions and live client demos\054 documenting and converting field observations directly into product\015decisions alongside the founding team\056\nRepresented the product at international client engagements\054 including an on\055site visit in Georgia\054 presenting UX decisions to clinical stakeholders with no design team support\056)
     /K [ 14 ]
     /P 1418 0 R
     /Pg 1397 0 R
     /S /Span
